,"#     print(\"Manual data for site hectares is not available. Cannot perform summation by cluster.\")\n","\n","print(\"Automatic summation by cluster is not feasible with the current OCR output.\")\n","print(\"Please manually review the OCR results and potential extracted numbers/names to create the correct data structure for summation.\")"],"execution_count":8,"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["Automatic summation by cluster is not feasible with the current OCR output.\n","Please manually review the OCR results and potential extracted numbers/names to create the correct data structure for summation.\n"]}]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{"id":"002ab9de"},"source":["# Task\n","Analyze the histogram in the image \"/content/qinghai_gansu_sites.png\" to sum the hectare area for each site cluster. This requires using OCR and Canny edge detection to extract data from the histogram bars and labels."]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{"id":"b341da80"},"source":["## Load and preprocess the image\n","\n","### Subtask:\n","Load the image and apply preprocessing techniques suitable for isolating histogram bars, such as converting to grayscale, noise reduction, and thresholding.\n"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{"id":"ee72d6cb"},"source":["**Reasoning**:\n","Load the image and apply preprocessing techniques suitable for isolating histogram bars as instructed.\n","\n"]},{"cell_type":"code","metadata":{"id":"dabca28f","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1755607625017,"user_tz":-60,"elapsed":112,"user":{"displayName":"Confoederatio","userId":"16561974736841499613"}}},"source":["import cv2\n","import numpy as np\n","\n","# Load the image\n","image_path = \"/content/qinghai_gansu_sites.png\"\n","image = cv2.imread(image_path)\n","\n","# Convert to grayscale\n","gray_image = cv2.cvtColor(image, cv2.COLOR_BGR2GRAY)\n","\n","# Apply Gaussian blur for noise reduction\n","blurred_image = cv2.GaussianBlur(gray_image, (5, 5), 0)\n","\n","# Apply Otsu's thresholding to create a binary image\n","_, processed_image_binary = cv2.threshold(blurred_image, 0, 255, cv2.THRESH_BINARY + cv2.THRESH_OTSU)\n","\n","# Store the preprocessed binary image\n","preprocessed_image = processed_image_binary\n","\n","# Display the processed image (optional)\n","# cv2.imwrite(\"processed_image.png\", preprocessed_image)\n","# print(\"Processed image saved as processed_image.png\")"],"execution_count":9,"outputs":[]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{"id":"d758a826"},"source":["## Identify histogram bars\n","\n","### Subtask:\n","Use image processing techniques (like contour detection or analyzing pixel distributions) to identify the regions corresponding to the histogram bars for each site cluster.\n"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{"id":"7184d87a"},"source":["**Reasoning**:\n","Find contours in the preprocessed binary image and filter them to identify potential histogram bars based on size and aspect ratio, then sort the identified bars by their x-coordinate.\n","\n"]},{"cell_type":"code","metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"id":"c2aa96b3","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1755607636725,"user_tz":-60,"elapsed":20,"user":{"displayName":"Confoederatio","userId":"16561974736841499613"}},"outputId":"b4109522-95af-4d77-c22b-7de51acd62b7"},"source":["# Find contours in the preprocessed image\n","contours, _ = cv2.findContours(preprocessed_image, cv2.RETR_EXTERNAL, cv2.CHAIN_APPROX_SIMPLE)\n","\n","# List to store potential bar bounding boxes\n","bar_boxes = []\n","\n","# Iterate through the found contours\n","for contour in contours:\n","    # Calculate the bounding box for each contour\n","    x, y, w, h = cv2.boundingRect(contour)\n","\n","    # Filter based on size and aspect ratio to identify potential bars\n","    # These thresholds might need adjustment based on the image resolution and content\n","    min_bar_width = 5\n","    min_bar_height = 10\n","    max_aspect_ratio = 0.5 # Assum