g**:\n","Attempt to associate the extracted potential bar heights with their corresponding site cluster labels based on their horizontal position.\n","\n"]},{"cell_type":"code","metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/"},"id":"801f4c6e","executionInfo":{"status":"ok","timestamp":1755607690391,"user_tz":-60,"elapsed":669,"user":{"displayName":"Confoederatio","userId":"16561974736841499613"}},"outputId":"a93cb1cc-e69c-4408-dd4b-fb733ac284d1"},"source":["# Re-perform OCR on the lower part of the image to specifically get site names and their positions.\n","# Crop the image to the lower section where site labels are expected.\n","# The full image height is image.shape[0]. Let's estimate the lower section.\n","# Based on the previous OCR output and visual inspection, the labels are near the bottom.\n","# Let's try cropping the bottom 20% of the image.\n","image_height = image.shape[0]\n","crop_y = int(image_height * 0.8)\n","cropped_image_for_labels = image[crop_y:, :]\n","\n","# Convert the cropped image to grayscale for OCR\n","gray_cropped_image = cv2.cvtColor(cropped_image_for_labels, cv2.COLOR_BGR2GRAY)\n","\n","# Use OCR to extract text from the cropped image\n","# Use a configuration that might help with text on a line\n","custom_config_labels = r'--oem 3 --psm 7' # psm 7 for assuming a single text line. May need adjustment.\n","ocr_output_labels = pytesseract.image_to_data(gray_cropped_image, output_type=pytesseract.Output.DICT, config=custom_config_labels)\n","\n","# Extract text and bounding boxes of the detected words/lines\n","extracted_label_info = []\n","n_boxes = len(ocr_output_labels['level'])\n","for i in range(n_boxes):\n","    text = ocr_output_labels['text'][i].strip()\n","    # Filter out empty strings or low confidence results\n","    if text and int(ocr_output_labels['conf'][i]) > 50: # Confidence threshold\n","        x = ocr_output_labels['left'][i]\n","        y = ocr_output_labels['top'][i] + crop_y # Adjust y to be relative to the original image\n","        w = ocr_output_labels['width'][i]\n","        h = ocr_output_labels['height'][i]\n","        extracted_label_info.append({'text': text, 'box': (x, y, w, h), 'confidence': int(ocr_output_labels['conf'][i])})\n","\n","# Filter for potential site names based on observed patterns (e.g., Q- or G-)\n","site_name_pattern = re.compile(r'([QG]-[A-Za-z]+)')\n","potential_site_labels = []\n","for item in extracted_label_info:\n","    if site_name_pattern.match(item['text']):\n","        potential_site_labels.append(item)\n","    # Also include the n= values if they are close to site names, as they provide positional context\n","    elif re.match(r'n=\\d+', item['text']):\n","         potential_site_labels.append(item)\n","\n","\n","# Sort potential site labels by their x-coordinate\n","potential_site_labels.sort(key=lambda item: item['box'][0])\n","\n","print(\"\\n--- Potential Site Labels and their bounding boxes (relative to original image) ---\")\n","for label_info in potential_site_labels:\n","    print(f\"Text: {label_info['text']}, Box: {label_info['box']}, Confidence: {label_info['confidence']}\")\n","\n","# --- Associate Bar Heights with Site Labels based on horizontal proximity ---\n","# This is a heuristic approach. We assume that bars are located horizontally above their labels.\n","# We'll iterate through sorted site labels and find potential bars whose x-range\n","# overlaps with the x-range of the label or is horizontally close.\n","\n","site_cluster_hectares = {}\n","\n","# Create a list of potential bar boxes with their original heights\n","potential_bars_with_heights = [(potential_bar_boxes[i], potential_bar_heights[i])\n","                               for i in range(len(potential_bar_boxes))]\n","\n","# Sort potential bars by their x-coordinate\n","potential_bars_with_heights.sort(key=lambda item: item[0][0])\n","\n","print(\"\\n--- Associating Bars with Site Labels ---\")\n","\n","# Simple spatial association: find bars whose horizontal center is closest to the label's center\n","# within a certain vertical range (i.e., above the label).\n","# This is highly sensitive to the image layout and OCR accuracy.\n","\n","label_bar_association_threshold_x = 50 # Max horizontal distance between centers\n","label_bar_vertical_offset_max = 300 # Max vertical distance (bars should be above labels)\n","\n","associated_data = {} # {site_name: [list of bar heights]}\n","\n","for label_info in potential_site_labels:\n","    label_box = label_info['box']\n","    label_text = label_info['text']\n","    label_center_x = label_box[0] + label_box[2] // 2\n","    label_y = label_box[1]\n","\n","    # Find potential bars associated with this label\n","    associated_bars_heights = []\n","    for bar_box, bar_height in potential_bars_with_heights:\n","        bar_x, bar_y, bar_w, bar_h = bar_box\n","        bar_center_x = bar_x + bar_w // 2\n","\n","        # Check if the bar is above the label and their horizontal centers are close\n","        if bar_y < label_y and abs(bar_center_x - label_center_x) < label_bar_association_threshold_x:\n","             # Further check if the bar's bottom is roughly aligned with the expected base of the chart,\n","             # and its top corresponds to a value. This level of detail is hard with just bounding boxes.\n","             # For now, we'll associate based on horizontal proximity and being above the label.\n","             associated_bars_heights.append(bar_height)\n","\n","    if associated_bars_heights:\n","        associated_data[label_text] = associated_bars_heights\n","        print(f\"Associated {len(associated_bars_heights)} bars with label '{label_text}'. Heights: {associated_bars_heights}\")\n","\n","print(\"\\n--- Associated Site Cluster Data (Heuristic) ---\")\n","print(associated_data)\n","\n","# Acknowledge the limitations:\n","print(\"\\n--- Limitations ---\")\n","print(\"The association of bar heights with site cluster labels is based on spatial proximity heuristics.\")\n","print(\"Accuracy is highly dependent on the quality of OCR for both bars and labels, and the consistency of the image layout.\")\n","print(\"Manual verification of the 'associated_data' dictionary is strongly recommended.\")\n","\n","# Store the associated data in a variable for the next step\n","associated_site_hectares_raw = associated_data"],"execution_count":14,"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["\n","--- Potential Site Labels and their bounding boxes (relative to original image) ---\n","\n","--- Associating Bars with Site Labels ---\n","\n","--- Associated Site Cluster Data (Heuristic) ---\n","{}\n","\n","--- Limitations ---\n","The association of bar heights with site cluster labels is based on spatial proximity heuristics.\n","Accuracy is highly dependent on the quality of OCR for both bars and labels, and the consistency of the image layout.\n","Manual verification of the 'associated_data' dictionary is strongly recommended.\n"]}]},{"cell_type":"markdown","metadata":{"id":"bb8214ce"},"source":["**Reasoning**:\n","The previous step failed to extract any site labels and thus could not associate bar heights. This indicates that the OCR on the cropped image for labels was not successful. I need to re-evaluate the OCR process for the labels, potentially adjusting the cropping area or OCR parameters, or trying to extract labels from the full image OCR output if possible. Looking at the very first OCR output (`extracted_text`), the site names were present there. I should try to parse the site names and their approximate horizontal positions from that output instead of doing a new OCR pass on a cropped image.\n","\n"]},{"cell_type":"code","metadata":{"colab":{"base_uri":"https://localhost:8080/","height":214},"id":"046d8ad7","executionInfo":{"status":"error","timestamp":1755607710175,"user_tz":-60,"elapsed":2251,"user":{"displayName":"Confoederatio","userId":"16561974736841499613"}},"outputId":"85d64779-f74a-4e78-ff17-